        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail for a solitaire adventure beneath the waves! Discover hundreds of beautifully crafted levels and restore the underwater kingdom of Atlantis to its shimmering glory. Face the mysteries of the deep as you challenge the mighty kraken, outsmart lurking anglerfish and swift stingrays, and disperse drifting sands and jellyfish swarms. Break through barriers and free cards trapped beneath stubborn barnacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162050/extras/f61ef2ec75cd81c466683e3fd27d2fe0.avif?t=1765468858\" width=400 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills across a wide variety of level types - from Supersize and Challenge layouts to engaging Match-2, Sliding, and Suit-or-Rank levels. Earn glistening emeralds, unlock majestic fish to inhabit scenes you've rebuilt, and watch each location burst to life with color and motion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its mesmerizing soundtrack, stunning visuals, and endlessly satisfying gameplay, Jewel Match  Atlantis Solitaire 5 - Collector's Edition invites you to dive once more into the splendor and secrets of Atlantis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162050/extras/68ebc8103ff22eeaf754afd30e22ee9c.avif?t=1765468858\" width=400 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 1000 Solitaire levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play over 60 Solitaire games – from beloved classics like Klondike and Spider to many original creations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 magnificent undersea palaces to build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play 4 different game modes: Normal, Hard, Relaxed and Timed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play supersize, challenge, sliding, match-2 and suit-or-rank bonus level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complete quests and earn rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose between multiple card decks to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock gorgeous wallpapers for your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy an ethereal soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162050/extras/088daf7539f74378592c8ff55337a9e5.webp?t=1765468858\" width=400 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail for a solitaire adventure beneath the waves! Discover hundreds of beautifully crafted levels and restore the underwater kingdom of Atlantis to its shimmering glory. Face the mysteries of the deep as you challenge the mighty kraken, outsmart lurking anglerfish and swift stingrays, and disperse drifting sands and jellyfish swarms. Break through barriers and free cards trapped beneath stubborn barnacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162050/extras/f61ef2ec75cd81c466683e3fd27d2fe0.avif?t=1765468858\" width=400 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills across a wide variety of level types - from Supersize and Challenge layouts to engaging Match-2, Sliding, and Suit-or-Rank levels. Earn glistening emeralds, unlock majestic fish to inhabit scenes you've rebuilt, and watch each location burst to life with color and motion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its mesmerizing soundtrack, stunning visuals, and endlessly satisfying gameplay, Jewel Match  Atlantis Solitaire 5 - Collector's Edition invites you to dive once more into the splendor and secrets of Atlantis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162050/extras/68ebc8103ff22eeaf754afd30e22ee9c.avif?t=1765468858\" width=400 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 1000 Solitaire levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play over 60 Solitaire games – from beloved classics like Klondike and Spider to many original creations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 magnificent undersea palaces to build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play 4 different game modes: Normal, Hard, Relaxed and Timed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play supersize, challenge, sliding, match-2 and suit-or-rank bonus level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complete quests and earn rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose between multiple card decks to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock gorgeous wallpapers for your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy an ethereal soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162050/extras/088daf7539f74378592c8ff55337a9e5.webp?t=1765468858\" width=400 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
